    // 交互式理论实验室：每个演示的说明和“模型说明与局限”
    demos: {
      grw: {
        intro: T('一个粒子处于两个相隔 2a 的高斯波包的叠加中。GRW 模型认为每个粒子会以极小的速率 λ 自发“局域化”：波函数乘以一个宽度为 r_C 的高斯函数，中心 x₀ 按 p(x₀) 随机出现。这里精确计算一次这样的事件。',
          'A particle is in a superposition of two Gaussian packets 2a apart. The GRW model holds that every particle spontaneously "localizes" at a tiny rate λ: the wavefunction is multiplied by a Gaussian of width r_C whose centre x₀ is drawn from p(x₀). Here one such event is computed exactly.'),
        notes: T('一维、单个粒子，只计算一次局域化事件，不包含两次局域化之间的自由演化。p(x₀) 和局域化后的波函数在 1201 个格点上数值积分得到。系综平均下，每次局域化把两峰之间的相干乘以 e^{−a²/r_C²}。λ 和 r_C 是 GRW 引入的新常数，原始取值 λ ≈ 10⁻¹⁶ s⁻¹、r_C ≈ 100 nm；XENON 合作组（2026）报告马尔可夫 CSL 的这一组原始取值已被实验排除。GRW 是理论假说，没有实验证实。',
          'One dimension, one particle, a single localization event; free evolution between events is not included. p(x₀) and the localized wavefunction are integrated numerically on 1201 grid points. Averaged over the ensemble, each event multiplies the coherence between the peaks by e^{−a²/r_C²}. λ and r_C are new constants introduced by GRW, originally λ ≈ 10⁻¹⁶ s⁻¹ and r_C ≈ 100 nm; the XENON collaboration (2026) reports that this original pair is excluded experimentally for Markovian CSL. GRW is a hypothesis with no experimental confirmation.'),
      },
      coherence: {
        intro: T('氨分子的翻转可以看成双势阱中的两能级体系：从左侧构型出发的分子，以隧穿劈裂 Δ 决定的频率在左右之间振荡。环境退相干和（假想的）坍缩模型都会在主方程里加入同样形式的退相干项，使振荡衰减。',
          'Ammonia inversion can be treated as a two-level system in a double well: a molecule starting on the left oscillates between left and right at a frequency set by the tunnelling splitting Δ. Environmental decoherence and a (hypothetical) collapse model both add a decoherence term of the same form to the master equation, damping the oscillation.'),
        notes: T('两能级近似：只保留左右两个局域态，H = −(Δ/2)σx，退相干项 𝒟[ρ] = (γ/2)(σzρσz − ρ)，γ = γ_env + Γ_CSL。左侧概率 P_L = (1 + z)/2，z 的阻尼振荡方程有解析解，这里直接用解析解计算。Γ_CSL 用尺寸远小于 r_C（取 100 nm）的刚性物体公式，m₀ 取 1 u。真实的氨分子翻转还涉及转动、振动激发与碰撞展宽，这里不包含。两种退相干在这个方程里形式完全相同，所以单凭衰减无法分辨来源。',
          'Two-level approximation: only the left and right localized states, H = −(Δ/2)σx, decoherence term 𝒟[ρ] = (γ/2)(σzρσz − ρ), γ = γ_env + Γ_CSL. The left-side probability P_L = (1 + z)/2, and the damped-oscillator equation for z is solved analytically. Γ_CSL uses the formula for a rigid body much smaller than r_C (taken as 100 nm), with m₀ = 1 u. Real ammonia inversion also involves rotation, vibrational excitation and collisional broadening, which are not included. Both kinds of decoherence have the same form in this equation, so the decay alone cannot reveal its source.'),
      },
      ci: {
        intro: T('两个电子态的势能面在二维核坐标 (x, y) 上的模型。Δ = 0 时两面在原点简并，形成圆锥交叉。沿闭合环路输运下层电子态，回到起点时它获得几何相位：环路绕过交叉点时为 π（实波函数变号），不绕过时为 0；Δ ≠ 0 时简并被打开，相位变为 d̂ 扫过的立体角的一半。',
          'A model of two electronic potential energy surfaces over two nuclear coordinates (x, y). With Δ = 0 they are degenerate at the origin, forming a conical intersection. Transporting the lower electronic state around a closed loop gives it a geometric phase on return: π when the loop goes around the intersection (the real wavefunction changes sign), 0 when it does not; with Δ ≠ 0 the degeneracy opens and the phase becomes half the solid angle swept by d̂.'),
        notes: T('H = d·σ + (k/2)(x² + y²)，d = (λy, Δ, κx)，k = 1。几何相位用离散 Wilson 环计算：γ = −arg ∏⟨u_j|u_{j+1}⟩（720 个点），与本征矢的相位约定无关。κ = λ 且环路以交叉点为中心时，与解析结果 |γ| = Ω/2、Ω = 2π(1 − Δ/√(Δ² + κ²r²)) 对照。真实分子的圆锥交叉处在多维构型空间中，这里只保留分支空间的两个坐标。',
          'H = d·σ + (k/2)(x² + y²) with d = (λy, Δ, κx) and k = 1. The geometric phase is computed as a discrete Wilson loop, γ = −arg ∏⟨u_j|u_{j+1}⟩ (720 points), independent of the eigenvectors\' phase convention. For κ = λ and a loop centred on the intersection it is checked against the analytic result |γ| = Ω/2 with Ω = 2π(1 − Δ/√(Δ² + κ²r²)). Real conical intersections live in a many-dimensional configuration space; only the two branching-space coordinates are kept here.'),
      },
    },

